msgid ""
"Tell TIDAL what you listen to, as its own apps do, for your history and "
"recommendations."
msgstr ""
"TIDAL 公式アプリと同様に、聴いた曲を TIDAL に伝え、履歴やおすすめに反映しま"
"す。"

